/**
 * ============================================================
 *  POPFEED — Automated Social Media Management Website
 * ============================================================
 *
 *  NO EXTERNAL ICON LIBRARIES — all icons are simple inline SVGs.
 *
 *  HOW THIS FILE IS ORGANIZED:
 *  1. Imports & Brand Config
 *  2. Icon Components (simple SVGs — easy to swap)
 *  3. Data (services, pricing, FAQ, etc.) — easy to edit!
 *  4. Small reusable components (Button, SectionHeading, etc.)
 *  5. Page sections (Hero, Features, Pricing, FAQ, Footer)
 *  6. Main App component that puts it all together
 *
 *  TO CUSTOMIZE:
 *  - Change colors → edit the BRAND object below
 *  - Change text → edit the data arrays in Section 3
 *  - Add/remove sections → edit the <App /> at the bottom
 * ============================================================
 */

